c	abcd/yk$c	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$BillingError	kind: extends Exception、构造器收 abcd/ok ⇒ 把后台任务的错误包成内购异常
c	abcd/yk$d	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$PurchaseResult	shape: 字段 = yk$e(状态) + cm$c(签名校验结果) + ok(错误)，4 个构造器组合三种 ⇒ 购买结果值对象
c	abcd/yk$e	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$PurchaseStatus	str: 枚举常量 OK_PURCHASED / OK_ALREADY_OWNED / ERROR ⇒ 购买状态
c	abcd/yk$f	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$ResponseCode	str: 枚举常量 RESULT_OK / RESULT_USER_CANCELED / RESULT_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE / RESULT_BILLING_UNAVAILABLE / RESULT_ITEM_UNAVAILABLE / RESULT_DEVELOPER_ERROR ⇒ Play 响应码
c	abcd/yk$g	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$Purchase	shape: 6 个 String + 1 个 long 的纯数据对象，构造器 (String×5, long, String) ⇒ 一条购买记录
c	abcd/yk$h	com/aide/billing/InAppBilling$SubscriptionWebServiceClient	str: "Subscription WS Client" + https://api.appfour.com/aideservices/subscriptions/v1/registerPurchase + "isGenuine" ⇒ 订阅校验 WebService 客户端（内部起 Thread）
c	abcd/rk	com/aide/billing/BuyIntentTask	kind: implements Runnable，字段 abcd/yk + String + 3 个 boolean；串 "BUY_INTENT"/"resp code for " ⇒ 触发购买的任务
